    "zh": "冷却舱抢空档",
    "en": "Cooling Bay Slot Hunt"
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "重叠预约 · 相接边界 · 最早时段",
    "en": "Overlapping bookings · Touching edges · Earliest slot"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "冷却舱从第 0 分钟开到 horizon 时刻。bookings 按开始时间升序，每笔 [开始, 结束] 占用从开始到结束前的整分钟，可能重叠或相接，且都在开放时段。给新的维修找 length 个连续空闲分钟，length 大于 0。返回最早开始时间，没有空档返回 -1。",
    "en": "The cooling bay opens at minute zero and closes at horizon. bookings is sorted by start time. Each [start, end] occupies whole minutes from start up to but excluding end. Bookings can overlap or touch and stay within opening hours. Find the earliest start for a repair of length consecutive free minutes, with length positive. Return -1 if it will not fit."
  },
  "hints": [],
  "functionName": "first_cooling_slot",
  "starterCode": "def first_cooling_slot(bookings, horizon, length):\n    pass\n",
  "solutionCode": "def first_cooling_slot(bookings, horizon, length):\n    free_start = 0\n    for booking in bookings:\n        if booking[0] >= free_start + length:\n            return free_start\n        if booking[1] > free_start:\n            free_start = booking[1]\n    if free_start + length <= horizon:\n        return free_start\n    return -1\n",
  "snippets": [
    {
      "label": {
        "zh": "读取预约始末",
        "en": "Read booking endpoints"
      },
      "code": "    for booking in bookings:\n        start = booking[0]\n        end = booking[1]"
    },
    {
      "label": {
        "zh": "时段是否放得下",
        "en": "Test whether a slot fits"
      },
      "code": "    fits = free_start + length <= horizon"
    }
